\p
\v 29 The next¦62825 day¦62824 Yohan saw¦62826 \nd Yeshua¦62830\nd* coming¦62831 towards him¦62833, and¦62834 said¦62835, “Hey! Here's the sacrificial lamb¦62838 of \nd God¦62840\nd* who's come to¦62832 take¦62842 away¦62842 the sin¦62845 of the world¦62848.
