\v 31 I didn't¦62871 know¦62872 who he was but¦62874 nevertheless I came¦62882 and¦62870 immersed¦62887 people in¦62875 water¦62886 so that¦62880 this¦62880 man could¦62876 be¦62876 revealed¦62876 to¦62878 \add all\add* Yisrael¦62878.”
