\v 33 I didn't¦62913 know¦62914 which one was him¦62915, but¦62910 the one who sent¦62918 me¦62919 to¦62920 immerse people in¦62921 water¦62923 said¦62926, ‘When¦62910 you¦62932 see¦62932 the spirit coming¦62935 down¦62935 and¦62910 settling on¦62938 someone, he is¦62943 the one who will immerse people with God's¦62948 holy¦62948 spirit.’
\v 34 And¦62953 I have¦62954 seen¦62952 that, and¦62951 so I can assure you that he is¦62957 God's son¦62960.”
\s1 Yeshua gets a few followers
