\p
\v 39 “\wj Come and see,\wj*” Yeshua replied. So¦63042 they went¦63041 with him¦63049 and saw¦63044 where¦63045 he¦63046 lived, and then they stayed there that¦63053 night, because it was¦63056 already late afternoon.
\p
\v 40 Andrew¦63062, the¦63063 brother¦63064 of Simon¦63065 Peter¦63066 was¦63060 one¦63068 of those two¦63071 who heard¦63073 Yohan¦63075 and¦63076 then followed¦63077 Yeshua.
\v 41 As soon as he found his¦63086 brother¦63085, he said¦63090 to¦63091 Simon¦63088, “We have¦63092 found the¦63093 messiah—God's chosen¦63094 one¦63094,”
\v 42 and led¦63102 him to¦63104 Yeshua. When Yeshua saw him, he said¦63113, “\wj Ah, you are Simon¦63117, Yohan's¦63120 son¦63119, but from now on you'll¦63122 be¦63123 called¦63123 Peter¦63128 which¦63125 means \+it stone\+it*.\wj*”
\s1 Philip and Nathanael join the group
