\p
\v 43 The¦63129 following¦63146 day¦63129, \nd Yeshua¦63145\nd* wanted¦63131 to go to Galilee¦63137. He found¦63139 Philip¦63140 and¦63141 told him¦63143, “\wj Follow¦63146 me!\wj*”
