\v 45 Philip then found Nathanael¦63164 and told him¦63167, “We've¦63177 found the one that Mosheh¦63170 and the prophets¦63176 wrote¦63169 about¦63183 in the Scriptures. He's \nd Yeshua¦63178\nd* from¦63186 \nd Nazareth¦63187\nd*.”
