\p
\v 10 But¦66932 \nd Yeshua¦66926\nd* told them to get all the people¦66929 to sit¦66930 down as there¦66931 was¦66931 a large grassy¦66934 area. So¦66932 they all sat¦66940 down—some five¦66950 thousand¦66950 men¦66944 were counted.
\v 11 Then he took the buns and gave¦66960 thanks¦66960 to¦66970 God, and started passing around both the buns and the fish¦66977, and everyone ate as much¦66978 as they¦66979 wanted¦66979.
