\v 14 The people¦67022 who had¦67024 witnessed this and other miracles¦67029 said¦67032, “This really is the prophet¦67038 that God promised to send!”
\v 15 But¦67051 \nd Yeshua¦67045\nd* knew¦67047 that¦67048 they¦67049 intended to come¦67050 and grab him to proclaim him as their king¦67059, so he¦67060 moved out of the crowd and on up the hill¦67065.
\s1 Yeshua comes walking across the lake
