\p
\v 16 As it¦67074 moved into evening¦67073, Yeshua's apprentices¦67077 went¦67075 back down¦67075 to¦67079 the¦67080 lake¦67081
\v 17 and having¦67084 boarded¦67084 the boat¦67087, they¦67088 set out across¦67092 the lake¦67094 toward Capernaum¦67096. By then¦67098 it was dark, and there was still no sign of \nd Yeshua¦67117\nd*.
