\v 39 \wj And what he wants is¦67609 for me to not lose¦67623 anyone that¦67618 he's¦67619 given¦67619 to me, but¦67608 to bring them back to life on¦67633 the¦67633 last¦67634 day¦67635.\wj*
\v 40 \wj My¦67648 father¦67645 wants everyone¦67650 who watches me and¦67655 believes¦67656 in¦67658 me to live forever¦67663, because¦67638 I will¦67665 bring them back to life¦67662 on¦67669 that¦67651 final day¦67672.\wj*”
\p
