\v 45 \wj The¦67769 prophets¦67770 wrote¦67767 that¦67779 the people will¦67772 be¦67772 taught¦67774 by \+nd God¦67776\+nd*. And¦67785 everyone who's heard¦67781 and¦67785 learnt¦67786 from¦67782 the father¦67784 comes¦67789 to¦67790 me.\wj*\x + \xo 6:45: \xt Isa 54:13.\x*
