\v 58 \wj Unlike your ancestors¦68137 who ate¦68135 that bread \+add from the sky\+add* and¦68142 then died¦68143, anyone who eats this¦68146 bread that came¦68131 down from heaven¦68130 will¦68151 live¦68151 through to¦68153 the next age¦68155.\wj*”
\s1 Many people find the teaching too difficult
\p
\v 59 Yeshua taught¦68162 all of this in the¦68160 \add ≈Jewish¦68160 meeting¦68160 hall¦68160\add* \add (Grk: synagogue)\add* there in Capernaum¦68164.
