\p
\v 1 After¦68418 all this, \nd Yeshua¦68422\nd* travelled around Galilee¦68427. (He¦68430 didn't¦68428 want to travel around Yudea¦68435 because¦68429 the leaders there wanted to execute him¦68439.)
\v 2 As it¦68443 was¦68443 now getting close to the Jewish Feast¦68447 With Tents,\x + \xo 7:2: \xt Lev 23:34; Deu 16:13.\x*
\v 3 his¦68459 brothers¦68458 said¦68453 to him, “You should leave this place and¦68464 go¦68465 down to Yudea¦68469 so that all your¦68474 followers¦68473 can see the miracles that you're¦68484 doing¦68484.
\v 4 If you want to become well-known, you don't do things out of the main stream. If you want to do miracles, \add go and\add* show yourself¦68505 to the wider world¦68507.
\v 5 (You see, not¦68508 even¦68508 Yeshua's own \add half-\add*brothers believed¦68514 \add that he came from God\add*.)
\p
\v 6 So¦68520 \nd Yeshua¦68523\nd* responded, “\wj Well, you guys can do that any time, but¦68533 it's not¦68528 the right time for me yet.\wj*
