\p
\v 12 Because of this, \nd Yeshua¦69742\nd* told them¦69738, “\wj \+em I am\+em* the light for the world¦69754—anyone who follows¦69756 me¦69757 won't¦69759 walk¦69760 in¦69762 the darkness¦69764 but¦69765 will¦69766 have¦69766 the light \+add that gives\+add* life¦69771.\wj*”\x + \xo 8:12: \xt Mat 5:14; Yhn 9:5.\x*
