\p
\v 1 As Yeshua was walking along, he¦70840 saw¦70840 a man¦70841 who had been blind¦70842 from¦70843 birth¦70844
\v 2 and¦70846 his followers¦70850 asked¦70847 him, “Honoured teacher, why was this¦70856 man¦70856 born¦70864 blind¦70863? Was it because he himself sinned¦70855, or his parents¦70860?”
