\v 3 \nd Yeshua\nd* answered¦70866, “\wj It wasn't either this¦70870 man¦70870 or his¦70875 parents¦70874 that sinned¦70871.\wj*\f + \fr 9:3 \ft We just want to alert our readers here that we have divided the Greek sentences here in a way that's different from the long-standing tradition. (The Greek originals have no punctuation, so either way is valid.)\f* \wj But so that \+nd God¦70882\+nd* can work¦70880 in him¦70884 for others to see,\wj*
