\v 16 “Well clearly that man¦71144 is¦71138 not¦71137 from¦71140 \nd God¦71142\nd*,” some¦71133 of them said, “because¦71145 he¦71149 doesn't respect the¦71146 Rest Day.”
\p However others said, “But¦71161 if he's¦71149 just a sinner, how could he do¦71160 miracles¦71158 like that?”
