\v 21 But as for how¦71264 come he can now¦71266 see¦71267, we don't¦71268 know that. Nor do we know who healed his¦71273 eyes¦71276. But ask¦71287 him—he's¦71267 old enough to speak¦71292 for himself¦71291.”
\v 22 (His¦71297 parents said these¦71293 things because they¦71299 were¦71299 afraid¦71299 of the Jewish religious leaders, because the leaders had¦71304 already¦71302 announced that anyone¦71311 who said that Yeshua was the \nd messiah¦71315\nd* would get banned from all religious ceremonies,
