\v 1 “\wj Honestly I can tell¦71709 you¦71710: It's not¦71713 the person that enters the sheep¦71722 enclosure by the gate that is¦71729 a thief¦71728 and¦71730 robber¦71731, but¦71723 rather the one who climbs in a different way¦71725.\wj*
