\v 10 \wj The thief¦71892 only comes to steal¦71900 and kill¦71904 and destroy¦71904, but¦71901 I came¦71907 so that¦71908 they¦71911 could¦71900 live, and live a full life¦71909.\wj*
\p
\v 11 “\wj \+em I am\+em* the good shepherd—the good shepherd gives his¦71929 own life¦71928 for¦71932 the sheep¦71934.\wj*\f + \fr 10:11 \ft See http://bibleandtech.blogspot.com/2021/04/john-1011-18-translations-and-notes-rcl.html\f*
