\v 16 \wj I also have¦72034 other sheep which¦72035 are not¦72037 in this¦72042 field¦72041 and¦72030 it's¦72045 appropriate¦72045 for me¦72046 to¦72048 bring¦72048 those¦72043 other sheep also, then¦72030 they'll¦72053 be hearing¦72053 my¦72052 voice¦72051 because there'll be just one flock¦72059 with¦72060 one shepherd¦72061.\wj*
