\v 25 \wj Anyone who loves¦74248 their life will lose¦74252 it¦74254, but¦74255 the person hating¦74257 their life in¦74261 this¦74264 world¦74263 will stay alive forever¦74269.\wj*\x + \xo 12:25: \xt Mat 10:39; 16:25; Mrk 8:35; Luk 9:24; 17:33.\x*
\v 26 \wj Anyone who wants to serve me needs¦74282 to follow¦74282 after¦74281 me, so that wherever¦74284 I am¦74286, my¦74294 servant¦74292 will also be there¦74289. Anyone who serves me will be honoured¦74303 by the father¦74306.\wj*
