\v 27 \wj Now, I'm very troubled. What else could¦74315 I say¦74315 other than, ‘Father¦74316, let me avoid what's coming’? But¦74313 it was exactly this that¦74322 I came¦74326 for.\wj*
\v 28 \wj Father¦74331, may your¦74335 authority be honoured.\wj*”
\p And a voice¦74354 from the sky answered, “I've already brought honour¦74333 to it¦74360 and¦74361 will¦74363 do so again¦74362.”
\p
\v 29 This caused some in the¦74364 crowd¦74367 standing¦74369 there to say that they'd heard¦74371 thunder¦74375 while others said¦74372 that a messenger¦74384 must have¦74377 spoken¦74386 to Yeshua.
\p
\v 30 “\wj That voice¦74399 wasn't for my¦74395 sake,\wj*” \nd Yeshua\nd* responded¦74392, “\wj but¦74403 for all of you¦74405.\wj*
\v 31 \wj This world is about¦74410 to be judged¦74407 and its ruler¦74414 will¦74419 be thrown¦74419 out,\wj*
\v 32 \wj and¦74422 when I'm lifted up\wj*\f + \fr 12:32 \ft lifted up / exalted: See https://bibleDifferences.net/2019/04/25/156-exulted\f* \wj from¦74428 the¦74430 earth¦74431, I will¦74434 attract everyone towards me.\wj*”
\v 33 By saying¦74441 this, he was indicating how he was going¦74445 to¦74446 die¦74446.
\p
\v 34 So¦74448 the crowd¦74451 queried him¦74449, “We heard¦74453 from the scriptures that the \nd messiah¦74459\nd* will stay until the end of the age¦74463 so why do you¦74468 say¦74467 that the son of humanity will be¦74471 lifted up? And who is¦74477 this¦74479 ‘the son of humanity’?”\x + \xo 12:34: \xt Psa 110:4; Isa 9:7; Eze 37:25; Dan 7:14.\x*
\p
\v 35 \nd Yeshua¦74488\nd* answered them, “\wj The light will¦74505 be¦74499 among you¦74496 all¦74496 for just a little¦74490 bit longer, so get walking while¦74501 you have the light so that¦74506 you won't¦74507 have to deal with darkness¦74508. Anyone walking in¦74517 the dark doesn't know¦74521 where¦74522 they're going¦74523.\wj*
\v 36 \wj While¦74524 you still have the light, believe¦74529 in¦74530 the light so that¦74533 you will¦74528 become¦74537 children of¦74536 light.\wj*”
