\p
\v 41 Yeshayah wrote this because¦74629 he¦74632 saw¦74632 the¦74633 messiah's greatness and¦74638 spoke¦74639 concerning¦74640 him.
\v 42 Likewise¦74642, many¦74649 of¦74647 the Jewish leaders¦74648 believed¦74650 that Yeshua was the messiah, but¦74653 they didn't tell others because¦74654 they didn't want the Pharisee¦74656 party¦74656 to banish them from their services
\v 43 as they¦74664 valued the¦74666 praise of¦74669 people¦74669 more¦74670 than¦74671 praise from \nd God¦74676\nd*.
\s1 It's Yeshua's teachings that will judge the hearers
