\r (Mat. 26:20-25; Mark 14:17-21; Luke 22:21-23)
\p
\v 21 After saying¦75294 these¦75280 things, \nd Yeshua's¦75283\nd* thoughts were troubled and he said¦75294, “\wj I can assure you that¦75298 one¦75299 of¦75300 you will¦75302 be¦75302 turning me¦75303 in.\wj*”
\p
\v 22 This made his apprentices¦75312 glance around at each other, puzzled about which one he was talking¦75318 about.
\v 23 \nd One¦75332\nd* of them that \nd Yeshua¦75337\nd* especially liked,\f + \fr 13:23 \ft This apprentice, unnamed here, is assumed to be the author of this account (being shy or modest).\f* was leaning against him¦75326 \add at the table\add*.
\v 24 So¦75339 Simon¦75341 Peter¦75342 nodded to him to find out who¦75345 Yeshua had been talking¦75360 about¦75358,
\v 25 and he leaned¦75363 back¦75363 on¦75368 \nd Yeshua¦75372\nd* and asked \add quietly\add*, “\nd Master¦75375\nd*, who¦75376 is¦75377 it¦75377?”
\p
\v 26 “\wj It's the one I hand¦75407 this piece of bread to after I've dipped¦75400 it \+add in the sauce\+add*,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75382\nd* answered¦75378. Then¦75397 after dipping his piece of bread in, he¦75407 gave¦75407 it to Yudas¦75408 Iscariot¦75412.
\v 27 After¦75414 \add Yudas accepted\add* the¦75415 piece¦75416 of¦75416 bread¦75416, Satan¦75422 entered into¦75419 him, and¦75413 then¦75413 \nd Yeshua¦75428\nd* told him, “What you're¦75430 about¦75416 to do, do it soon.”
\v 28 But¦75435 none of¦75438 the others sitting¦75439 around the table knew¦75437 what¦75441 Yeshua meant.
\v 29 Some¦75444 of them thought that since Yudas¦75455 held their purse, perhaps \nd Yeshua¦75460\nd* was getting him¦75458 to buy something they needed for¦75467 the feast¦75469 or¦75470 to give¦75475 something to the poor¦75472.
\p
\v 30 Anyway, having¦75476 eaten the¦75478 piece¦75479 of¦75479 bread¦75479, Yudas went¦75482 straight outside where it¦75484 was¦75484 already dark.
\s1 The new command to love each other
\rem /s1 The New Commandment; Jesus Predicts Peter's Denial
\p
\v 31 After Yudas had gone, \nd Yeshua¦75492\nd* told the others, “\wj Now the son¦75496 of humanity will be honoured and¦75499 \+nd God¦75501\+nd* will be honoured through him¦75504.\wj*
\v 32 \wj Also \+nd God¦75514\+nd* himself¦75518 will be¦75515 honouring him¦75516 and¦75520 will do that immediately¦75521.\wj*
\v 33 \wj My friends, I'll only be with¦75530 you a little¦75528 bit longer. Then you'll all look for me¦75534 and¦75535 as¦75536 I told\wj*\x + \xo 13:33: \xt Yhn 7:34.\x* \wj the¦75539 religious leaders, you won't¦75547 be able¦75548 to¦75549 go where I'm¦75532 going¦75544. So now¦75554 I've also¦75550 told all of you.\wj*
\v 34 \wj I'm¦75557 giving¦75557 you a new¦75556 command¦75555—you need to love each other. The way that I loved¦75565 all¦75560 of you is how you should love each other.\wj*\x + \xo 13:34: \xt Yhn 15:12,17; 1Yhn 3:23; 2Yhn 5.\x*
\v 35 \wj This¦75575 is actually how you'll know¦75577 if you're my¦75581 follower¦75582: if you're loving¦75586 each other.\wj*”
\s1 Yeshua predicts that Peter will disown him
