\r (Mat. 26:31-35; Mark 14:27-31; Luke 22:31-34)
\p
\v 36 Now Peter¦75596 followed-up, “\nd Master¦75597\nd*, where¦75598 are¦75599 you¦75617 going¦75599?”
\p “\wj Where¦75605 I'm¦75607 going,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75604\nd* answered¦75600, “\wj you won't¦75608 be able¦75609 to¦75612 follow me at this stage, but¦75618 you will¦75617 follow me eventually.\wj*”
\p
\v 37 Peter¦75626 asked again, “Why¦75629 can't¦75630 I follow¦75636 after¦75633 you now¦75638? I'm¦75631 prepared to give my¦75643 life¦75642 for¦75644 you.”
\p
\v 38 “\wj You¦75660 think you'll¦75675 be¦75660 giving your¦75657 life¦75656 for¦75658 me?\wj*” \nd Yeshua\nd* responded. “\wj I can assure you that¦75673 the¦75669 rooster¦75669 won't¦75668 crow¦75670 until¦75672 you've already disowned¦75675 knowing me three¦75679 times.\wj*”
\c 14
\s1 Yeshua is the road to the father but will be leaving
\rem /s1 Jesus, the Way to the Father; Jesus Comforts His Disciples
\p
\v 1 \add Yeshua continued telling them,\add* “\wj Don't be¦75686 living in fear. You¦75687 believe that \+nd God¦75693\+nd* is real, and you¦75690 also¦75694 believe that I was sent by him.\wj*
\v 2 \wj There are¦75706 many places to live in my¦75703 father's¦75702 residence—I would¦75712 have told¦75711 you if there wasn't because¦75714 I'm¦75715 going¦75715 there to prepare¦75716 a place¦75717 for all of you.\wj*
\v 3 \wj And after I've gone¦75723 to prepare¦75725 that place¦75728, then¦75721 I'll¦75736 be coming¦75733 back again¦75732 and¦75721 will bring you to myself¦75739, so that where¦75741 I am¦75742, you can all¦75746 be there also.\wj*
\v 4 \wj You¦75753 know¦75753 how to get where¦75750 I'm¦75751 going¦75752.\wj*”
\rem /s1 Jesus the Way to the Father
\p
\v 5 “\nd Master¦75764\nd*,” Thomas asked, “we¦75766 don't¦75765 \add even\add* know \em where¦75767\em* you're¦75768 going¦75768, let alone how¦75770 to¦75775 get there.”
\p
\v 6 And \nd Yeshua\nd* answered, “\wj \+em I am\+em* the path¦75785 and the truth¦75788 and the life¦75791. No one¦75792 can get to¦75794 the father¦75796 except¦75797 via me.\wj*
\v 7 \wj If you had¦75803 all¦75803 known me¦75804, you would also¦75805 have known my¦75808 father¦75807, and from¦75814 now¦75815 on you do know him and have seen¦75820 him.\wj*”
\p
\v 8 So Philip said¦75822, “\nd Master¦75826\nd*, show¦75827 us the father¦75830 and¦75831 that'll be enough for¦75833 us.”
\p
\v 9 “\wj I've been with¦75842 you¦75843 all¦75843 for quite some time¦75840,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75837\nd* replied, “\wj and¦75845 yet you still don't¦75846 \+add even\+add* know¦75847 me¦75848, Philip¦75849.\wj*
\v 10 \wj You don't believe¦75867 that I am in the father and¦75874 the father is in me. These things that I've been telling¦75884 you¦75887 all¦75887, I don't \+add just\+add* make them up myself¦75889, but¦75874 the father who lives in me is doing¦75900 what he wants.\wj*
\v 11 \wj You all need to believe that I am in the father and¦75912 the father is in me¦75916. If¦75921 that's hard, at least believe it because¦75925 of¦75925 what he's doing.\wj*
\v 12 \wj I can assure you¦75936 all¦75936 that anyone who believes¦75938 \+add that God sent\+add* me and is the source of the miracles that I do, that person will¦75947 be¦75947 able to do the same and even greater¦75950 miracles because¦75953 I am¦75959 going¦75959 to the father¦75957.\wj*
\v 13 \wj Whatever¦75962 you¦75966 request¦75966 from me¦75973 with my¦75973 name¦75972 and¦75961 authority, I will¦75975 do¦75975 it so that¦75974 the father¦75979 might be¦75977 honoured because of¦75973 the son.\wj*
\v 14 \wj Anything¦75985 that¦75992 you¦75986 all¦75986 request¦75986 using my¦75991 name¦75990 and authority will¦75994 be¦75994 done¦75994.\wj*
\s1 The father will be sending a different advocate
