\p
\v 15 “\wj If you¦75996 all¦75996 love¦75996 me¦75998, you will¦76003 obey my¦76002 commands¦76000.\wj*
\v 16 \wj Then¦76006 I will ask¦76009 the¦76011 father¦76012, and¦76006 he¦76017 will give¦76017 you \+add ≈a different¦76015\+add* assistant to¦76025 be¦76028 with¦76022 you¦76018 all¦76018 for this age¦76027—\wj*
\v 17 \wj the¦76032 \+nd spirit¦76033\+nd* of¦76035 truth¦76035. The world¦76038 can't¦76039 accept him, because¦76042 it¦76044 doesn't see or know him.\wj*
\p
\v 18 “\wj And I won't¦76065 leave¦76066 you¦76067 all¦76067 here as orphans¦76068, but I'll come¦76069 back to¦76070 you.\wj*
\v 19 \wj It won't be long now and the¦76075 world¦76076 won't see me any more, but¦76074 you will see me because¦76084 I'll be alive and you¦76080 all¦76080 will be alive also.\wj*
\v 20 \wj At that time you will know¦76097 that I am in my¦76104 father¦76103, and you all are in me¦76108, and I am in you all.\wj*
\p
\v 21 “\wj Anyone who takes my commands¦76117 and obeys them, that's¦76122 the¦76124 person who loves me, and anyone who loves me will be loved¦76131 by¦76133 my father¦76135, and I \+add too\+add* will be loving¦76140 them and will be revealing myself¦76146 to¦76145 them.\wj*”
\p
\v 22 Yudas (not Yudas Iscariot¦76156) asked, “\nd Master¦76158\nd*, what's¦76160 going¦76165 on? Why would you¦76165 reveal yourself¦76170 to us¦76164 and¦76171 not to the¦76173 \add whole\add* world¦76174?”
\p
\v 23 \nd Yeshua\nd* answered¦76175, “\wj If anyone¦76182 loves me, they'll obey my teaching, and my father¦76192 will love them and we¦76200 will go to¦76197 that person and live with¦76207 them.\wj*
\v 24 \wj But¦76224 anyone who doesn't love¦76214 me, won't¦76213 obey my teaching. The words that you¦76230 hear¦76230 from me are¦76230 not¦76231 my own, but¦76234 come from the¦76235 father¦76238 who sent¦76236 me.\wj*
\p
\v 25 “\wj I told you all this while I have¦76240 been here with¦76242 you all.\wj*
\v 26 \wj But¦76267 the holy¦76252 \+nd spirit¦76250\+nd*, the assistant who the father¦76257 will be sending¦76254 with my¦76262 authority, he will be teaching¦76265 you everything, and¦76267 will be reminding¦76268 you of everything that¦76271 I told you¦76264 all¦76264.\wj*
\p
\v 27 \wj I will leave¦76278 peace with¦76279 you all. I'm giving my¦76282 peace to¦76284 you all, but what I'm giving isn't¦76285 like what the¦76297 world¦76288 gives. Don't¦76285 be¦76300 upset or afraid¦76300.\wj*
\v 28 \wj You¦76301 all¦76301 heard¦76301 me say¦76304 that I'm going away¦76306 and¦76307 then will be coming¦76308 back. If you really loved¦76312 me, you'd be very happy that I'm going to¦76320 the father, because¦76324 the father is¦76330 greater¦76328 than¦76328 me.\wj*
\p
\v 29 \wj But¦76331 I've¦76333 told¦76333 you now¦76332 before¦76335 it happens, so that when it does come to pass, you'll be able to believe¦76340 \+add that it was preplanned\+add*.\wj*
\v 30 \wj I won't¦76357 have much¦76343 more time to talk to you¦76346, because¦76348 the ruler¦76353 of¦76350 the world¦76351 is¦76347 coming¦76347 and¦76354 he¦76358 has nothing¦76359 in¦76355 common with me,\wj*
\v 31 \wj but¦76370 he's coming so¦76378 that the world¦76365 can know¦76363 that I love¦76367 the father and¦76370 whatever the father told me to do, I'm¦76367 doing¦76379 it.\wj*
\p “\wj Come on, stand up. We¦76381 need to be¦76381 leaving this place.\wj*”
\c 15
\s1 The branches must stay connected to the vine
\rem /s1 Jesus, the True Vine; Jesus the Real Vine; The Vine and the Branches
\p
\v 1 “\wj \+em I am\+em* the true¦76388 vine¦76386 and¦76389 my¦76392 father¦76391 is¦76395 the farmer¦76394.\wj*
\v 2 \wj He¦76404 removes every¦76407 one of my branches¦76397 that doesn't bear fruit, but¦76406 those that do bear fruit, he prunes them so they'll produce¦76403 even more.\wj*
\v 3 \wj You are all¦76433 clean¦76425 already¦76423 because¦76427 of¦76427 the¦76428 teaching that¦76430 I've¦76431 given you¦76433.\wj*
\v 4 \wj Stay in me, and¦76438 I will stay in you¦76440 all¦76440, because just as a branch¦76443 can't¦76444 bear¦76447 fruit¦76446 in isolation when it's not connected to the¦76455 vine¦76456, neither¦76458 can you if¦76460 you don't¦76444 stay in me.\wj*
\p
\v 5 “\wj \+em I am\+em* the vine¦76473 and¦76481 you¦76474 all¦76474 are¦76474 the branches¦76476. Anyone who stays in¦76479 me will¦76474 produce¦76486 a lot of fruit¦76486—apart¦76489 from¦76489 me you can't¦76491 do¦76493 anything.\wj*
\v 6 \wj Anyone¦76500 who doesn't stay in¦76503 me¦76504 will be thrown away like a branch¦76510, and will wither¦76512 and be gathered¦76514 together¦76514 with others, and thrown into¦76518 the¦76519 fire¦76520 to be burnt¦76524.\wj*
\v 7 \wj If you stay in me¦76530 and my¦76534 teaching stays in you, then you can request¦76544 whatever¦76538 you¦76528 all¦76528 want¦76542 and it¦76547 will¦76547 be¦76547 done for you.\wj*
\v 8 \wj My¦76554 father¦76553 will be¦76560 honoured and praised when you produce¦76556 a lot of fruit¦76556, and you¦76560 all¦76560 become¦76562 my¦76554 followers.\wj*
\v 9 \wj I loved you¦76575 all¦76575 just as the¦76571 father¦76572 loved me¦76570, so stay in¦76578 my¦76582 love¦76580.\wj*
\v 10 \wj If you obey my commands, you¦76589 all¦76589 will¦76591 be¦76591 staying in my love, just like I've¦76598 obeyed my father's¦76602 commands and¦76609 I am¦76610 staying in his¦76611 love.\wj*
\p
