\v 29 So¦78936 Governor Pilate¦78940 came¦78935 outside¦78941 to¦78942 them¦78943 and¦78945 asked, “What charge are¦78950 you¦78950 all¦78950 bringing¦78950 against¦78951 this¦78954 man¦78953?”
