\p
\v 35 Pilate¦79065 retorted, “Hoy! I'm not¦79066 a Jew. It was your own people and¦79076 the¦79077 chief¦79079 priests¦79079 that handed you over¦79081 to¦79083 me¦79083. What have you done¦79085?”
\p
\v 36 “\wj My¦79093 kingdom isn't in this¦79099 world,\wj*” \nd Yeshua\nd* answered¦79086, “\wj because if¦79100 it was¦79107, my supporters would¦79120 have fought¦79119 so that¦79099 I wouldn't¦79120 have been handed over¦79123 to¦79124 the Jewish leaders. But no, my kingdom isn't from¦79135 here.\wj*”
