\p
\v 25 Meanwhile a group of women had¦79822 stayed standing¦79822 near \nd Yeshua¦79828\nd* on the stake¦79826: his mother and his aunt, Maria the wife¦79839 of Clopas¦79841, and Maria from¦79845 Magdala¦79845.
