\p
\v 1 After¦80962 all this, \nd Yeshua¦80970\nd* revealed¦80965 himself¦80967 again¦80968 to¦80972 his apprentices¦80973 at¦80975 Lake Galilee. It happened like this:
\v 2 Simon Peter¦80986, Thomas¦80988 nicknamed ‘Twin’, Nathanael¦80993 from¦80997 Cana¦80998 in Galilee¦81000, the sons¦81002 of¦81006 Zebedee¦81006, and¦81008 two¦81015 other¦81009 apprentices¦81012 had gathered together¦80984
